00:37:40.340 --> 00:37:41.080
Where I am?

00:37:43.240 --> 00:37:44.940
Who are you?

00:37:45.600 --> 00:37:48.500
Look at the sky Knight who has been filled with arrogance.

00:37:49.000 --> 00:37:51.800
